@api = http://localhost:5000

### 1. Health check - expected 200
GET {{api}}/

### 2. Book list - expected 200 and JSON array
GET {{api}}/api/books

### 3. Search books by keyword - expected 200 and filtered JSON array
GET {{api}}/api/books?keyword=programming

### 4. Existing book detail - expected 200
GET {{api}}/api/books/1

### 5. Unknown book - expected 404 ApiError BOOK_NOT_FOUND
GET {{api}}/api/books/999

### 6. Non-integer book id - expected framework 404 with empty body
GET {{api}}/api/books/abc

### 7. Create a reservation - expected 201 and Location
# @name createReservation
POST {{api}}/api/books/1/reservations
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "studentCode": "DTC245200499",
  "studentName": "Tran Van Thuong"
}

### 8. Read the created reservation - expected 200
GET {{api}}/api/reservations/{{createReservation.response.body.$.id}}

### 9. Missing required values - expected 400 ApiError INVALID_RESERVATION
POST {{api}}/api/books/1/reservations
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "studentCode": "",
  "studentName": ""
}

### 10. No available copies - expected 409 ApiError NO_COPIES_AVAILABLE
POST {{api}}/api/books/4/reservations
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "studentCode": "DTC245200499",
  "studentName": "Tran Van Thuong"
}

### 11. Framework content-type handling - expected 415
POST {{api}}/api/books/1/reservations

{
  "studentCode": "DTC245200499",
  "studentName": "Tran Van Thuong"
}
